      55.05,
      406.26,
      295.1,
      460.14
    ],
    "text": "I, Wijesundara Mudiyanselage Thilakarathna Bandara Ekanayaka,Acting Minister of Lands hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) ofSection 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described belowis needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under theprovisions of that Act.",
